%U A391632 10377369263383,62668963071925,378458048186527,2285509240092589,13802196867711143,83351506551819813,503359987652045615
%N A391632 Number of mutual-visibility sets in the n-Andrásfai graph.
%H A391632 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/AndrasfaiGraph.html">Andrásfai Graph</a>.
%H A391632 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/VisibilityPolynomial.html">Visibility Polynomial</a>.
%F A391632 Conjectured g.f.: x*(4 - 19*x + 33*x^2 - 40*x^3 + 8*x^4)/(1 - 10*x + 29*x^2 - 32*x^3 + 8*x^4). - _Andrew Howroyd_, Jan 12 2026
%F A391632 For n >= 2, a(n) = trace(M^(3*n-1)), where M is the eight-state transfer matrix for mutual-visibility sets:
%F A391632 M = [[1,0,0,0,1,0,0,0],
%F A391632      [0,0,0,0,2,0,0,0],
%F A391632      [0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0],
%F A391632      [0,0,0,0,0,1,0,0],
%F A391632      [1,0,0,0,0,0,1,0],
%F A391632      [0,0,0,0,1,0,1,0],
%F A391632      [0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0],
%F A391632      [0,0,0,0,0,1,0,0]].
%F A391632 The stated g.f. follows from this formula together with a(1) = 4. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Oct 29 2026
